{"2744390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dawning Clocks of Time® Remake", "steam_appid": 2744390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4639550], "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dawning Clocks of Time - Director's Cut (Original Game) Is now bundled with THE DAWNING CLOCKS OF TIME REMAKE, to help introduce new players to the franchise!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1781738468\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1781738468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1781738468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/48a92cc2f7af34e0598ef2c4ce3b0f5a.avif?t=1781738468\" width=429 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dawning Clocks of Time® Remake — A Cinematic Sci‑Fi Epic Reborn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dying star. A fractured galaxy. A relic that can rewrite reality.</strong> Step into a sweeping saga of <strong>love, war, betrayal, and cosmic destiny</strong> in this fully remade HD/4K sci‑fi noir adventure — rebuilt as a <strong>third‑person survival shooter</strong> with modern controls, atmospheric presentation, and a galaxy’s worth of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Sven Chandra</strong>, a Federation bounty hunter wielding the mysterious <strong>Dawning Rune</strong>, a relic capable of bending space and time. As the <strong>Progenitor War</strong> erupts across the stars, three chosen individuals stand between humanity and extinction. The clocks are ticking — and they will not wait.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete HD/4K remake</strong> of the cult indie sci‑fi RPG, now reborn as a cinematic third‑person shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice acting</strong>, atmospheric soundtrack, and a rich narrative written by novelist <strong>Jake Stephen Jackson</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, reactive combat</strong> with plasma rifles, pistols, melee weapons, and an <strong>Active Battle Slot System</strong> that changes encounters every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A galaxy to explore</strong> — diverse planets, side quests, and story arcs woven into a noir‑infused sci‑fi universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival‑game DNA</strong> with fixed cinematic camera angles <i>or</i> optional free‑movement third‑person controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox freedom meets linear storytelling</strong> for a hybrid experience that rewards both exploration and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now includes the full Director’s Cut of the Original Game</strong> — perfect for newcomers discovering the franchise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/bb9f6933cd2ae34f58c8cfa2d4ac0a6c.poster.avif?t=1781738468\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/bb9f6933cd2ae34f58c8cfa2d4ac0a6c.webm?t=1781738468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/bb9f6933cd2ae34f58c8cfa2d4ac0a6c.mp4?t=1781738468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744390/extras/b87ba8b47800d16c0dd45af95388887f.avif?t=1781738468\" width=429 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third‑Person Survival Shooter</strong> with cinematic presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battle Slot Mechanic</strong> that alters combat flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge enemy roster</strong> across multiple planets and biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story‑rich campaign</strong> with noir‑sci‑fi tone and dramatic twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional tank controls</strong> for classic survival‑horror fans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switchable camera modes</strong> for modern or retro playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A universe on the brink</strong> — uncover the truth behind the Dawning Rune and the coming supernova</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every purchase includes: <strong>✔ The Dawning Clocks of Time® Remake</strong> — the definitive HD/4K version <strong>✔ The Original Game: Director’s Cut</strong> — preserved for fans and newcomers alike. Also will include the upcoming Time Hunter's Overhaul DLC Expansion Pack for free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Clocks Are Set. The Galaxy Is Waiting.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a journey across time, space, and fate itself. <strong>Will you be the one to stop the end of everything?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa